sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Android central
  participant H as HUD peripheral
  A->>H: Connect and request ATT MTU
  H-->>A: MTU result / negotiated value
  A->>H: Discover service, enable TX notifications
  H-->>A: CCCD write confirmed
  A->>H: HELLO (framed, fragmented, CRC32)
  H->>H: Reassemble, bounds check, CRC and protobuf decode
  H-->>A: HELLO_ACK (framed and fragmented)
  A->>A: Validate version and payload cap
  A->>H: Snapshot state messages
  Note over A,H: Android writes await each GATT write callback; no claim of credit-window throughput
  H-->>A: Settings/status notifications as produced
